  "subject": "A 71-year-old raised in a hillside squatter hut with no playground rides the long slide in Tuen Mun Park for the first time because his four-year-old granddaughter won't go alone, then climbs back up by himself while she waits below to catch him.",
  "caption": "Cantonese Hawaiian hapa-haole, island porch swing. Lap steel guitar gliding between notes with slow vibrato, fingerpicked slack-key acoustic guitar, tenor ukulele strummed on the off-beats, upright bass in a two-feel, brushed snare. Warm open-air acoustic mix, lap steel and ukulele forward. Female soprano, clear and sunny, gentle but full-voiced, clearly sung melody on every line. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 92 BPM, G major. Sunlit, unhurried and tender. No trap drums, no autotune, no rap, no electric guitar distortion, no EDM drops, no breathy whisper.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n阿爺七十一歲\n從來未上過滑梯\n喺山邊寮屋長大\n冇人帶佢去公園\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n孫女四歲 企喺梯頂\n話你唔落 我都唔落\n\n[Chorus]\n滑落去 滑落去\n阿爺你都試吓啦\n風吹起條白頭髮\n笑聲響晒成個公園\n\n[Verse]\n條梯幾長 佢手心出汗\n閉住眼 坐低先\n嗖一聲 就到地\n原來係咁好玩\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n孫女拍手 跳吓跳吓\n話阿爺 再嚟一次\n\n[Chorus]\n滑落去 滑落去\n阿爺你都試吓啦\n風吹起條白頭髮\n笑聲響晒屯門公園\n\n[Verse]\n佢自己行返上梯頂\n一級一級 慢慢爬\n孫女企喺下面 張開手\n話阿爺 我接住你\n\n[Bridge]\n山邊嗰間屋 冇滑梯\n而家有個細路女\n企喺度 等佢落嚟\n\n[Chorus]\n滑落去 滑落去\n阿爺你唔使驚\n風吹起條白頭髮\n有人喺下面接住\n\n[Chorus]\n滑落去 滑落去\n阿爺你唔使驚\n風吹起條白頭髮\n有人喺下面接住\n\n[Outro]\n滑落去 滑落去\n阿爺 我接住你",
